title: A video as a card: goto, open, the menu on it, an ignored one, and its folder taken off the canvas while it is there
folders: media, plain

wait 3500
left files
tab 1
wait 800
goto video/clip.mp4
wait 2500
mark video-card
wait 500
menu 1000 450
wait 600
mark video-menu
wait 500
ui click 370 420
wait 300
open video/clip.mp4
wait 2000
mark video-open
wait 500
zoom 0.5
wait 900
mark video-zoomed-out
wait 500
zoom 4
wait 900
mark video-zoomed-in
wait 500
ignored ignored/kept out.mp4
wait 2500
mark video-ignored
wait 500
left changes
wait 800
mark video-other-panel
wait 500
left settings
wait 800
mark video-under-settings
wait 500
left settings:close
goto video/clip.mp4
wait 2000
workspace off {FIX}\media
wait 1500
mark folder-off
wait 500
workspace put {FIX}\media
wait 2500
mark folder-back
wait 500
quit
